会学习,符合新课程改革的教学观要求。(2分)", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 867813, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 8, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 8, "source": "2019年", "starCount": 0, "title": "简述“授之以鱼”不如“授之以渔”的教育学意义。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 867813, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 30}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "爱国主义教育;理想教育;集体主义教育;劳动教育;自觉纪律教育;民主和法制教育;科学世界观和人生观教育;道德教育;生态教育。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 867814, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 8, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 8, "source": "2019年", "starCount": 0, "title": "简述我国当前中小学德育的主要内容。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 867814, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 31}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">下面是马老师《圆的认识》一课的教学摘要:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">师:想一想,从古至今,为什么车轮都设计成圆形的?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">生:这样可以滚动;这样快;不震荡;光滑……</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">师:车轮设计成圆形的,光滑,不震动,跑得快,这又是为什么呢?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">生:如果不是圆的,是三角形的,车轮就会一颠一颠的,走起路来不平稳。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">生:四边形好一点,不,五边形更好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">生:正多边形,边越多越好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">师:(随着发言出示课件)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/Upload/image/20200331/6372126815996530329605499.png\" title=\"clip_image001.png\"/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">师:那么究竟要正多少边形来做车轮就会不颠了呢?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">生:7,8,11,…,13,14,…，100</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">师:(边演示边引导学生想象)是这样吗?边数越来越多……</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/Upload/image/20200331/6372126816014400271891112.jpg\" title=\"clip_image003.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">生(兴奋地大声说):边数越多,多到无数条,那样的多边形的边就几乎看不到了,角也看不到了,中心点到边和到角顶点的距离都相等了,成了圆形车轮,就不会颠簸了,就平稳了。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">师:那么什么是圆呢?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">师生:在一个平面内,当中心点到边的每个点的距离都相等时,这就是圆。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">问题：马老师在这节课中主要贯彻了哪些教学原则?请结合案例加以分析。</span></p><p><br/></p>", "exerId": 867815, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">马老师在这节课中主要贯彻了以下教学原则:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(1)直观性原则。马老师在带领学生认识“圆”的过程中,先引导学生开展积极的思维活动,然后适时地出示课件,将学生思维中可以滚动的形状按照“三角形—正多边形—圆形”的发展脉络直观地用课件图形一一演示出来,并在演示中进行必要的补充讲解和说明。(5分)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(2)启发性原则。马老师设置问题情境,恰到好处地进行点拨,启发学生积极思维。马老师依次抛出“为什么车轮都设计成圆形的?”“为什么圆形的车轮光滑、不震动、跑得快?”“要正多少边形做车轮才会不颠簸?“什么是圆?”等问题,一步一步地引导、点拨、启发学生思考问题。(5分)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(3)循序渐进原则。马老师从“为什么车轮都设计成圆形的?”这个问题入手,引导学生探究车轮圆形设计的必然性,进而论证三角形正多边形都不适合做车轮,渐渐引导学生分析归纳出正多边形边数越多越平稳,最后得出“圆”的定义。可见,马老师是按照学生认知顺序,由浅入深、由易到难、由简到繁、由具体到抽象,引导学生循序渐进地认识“圆”。(5分)</span></p><p><br/></p>", "keyType": "案例分析题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 15, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 15, "source": "2019年", "starCount": 0, "title": "问题：马老师在这节课中主要贯彻了哪些教学原则?请结合案例加以分析。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 867815, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 32}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)识记材料的性质与数量。(2分)\n(2)学习的程度。(2分)\n(3)识记材料的序列位置。(2分)\n(4)识记者的态度。(2分)", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 867830, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 8, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 8, "source": "2019年", "starCount": 0, "title": "简述影响遗忘进程的因素。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 867830, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 33}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)加强科学思维方法论的训练。(2分)\n(2)运用启发式进行教学,提高学生学习的积极性。(2分)\n(3)加强言语交流训练。(1分)\n(4)发挥定势的积极作用。(1分)\n(5)培养解决实际问题的思考能力。(2分)", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 867831, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 8, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 8, "source": "2019年", "starCount": 0, "title": "如何培养学生良好的思维品质?", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 867831, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 34}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)培养乐观向上的人生态度。(2分)\n(2)培养广泛的兴趣和爱好。(1分)\n(3)丰富积极的情绪体验。(1分)\n(4)学会自我接纳与自我欣赏。(2分)\n(5)建立良好的人际关系。(1分)\n(6)正确面对和处理负性情绪。(1分)", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 867832, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType